&lt;h2&gt;4-Phase Workflow&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="4-phase-workflow"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#4-phase-workflow" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Phase 1: Analysis&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="phase-1-analysis"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#phase-1-analysis" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Brainstorming, research, product briefs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Phase 2: Planning&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="phase-2-planning"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#phase-2-planning" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PRD creation, UX design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Phase 3: Solutioning&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="phase-3-solutioning"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#phase-3-solutioning" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architecture, ADRs, epic/story breakdown&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Phase 4: Implementation&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="phase-4-implementation"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#phase-4-implementation" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sprint planning, story implementation, code review&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Folder Structure&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="folder-structure"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#folder-structure" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;project/
├── _bmad/ ← BMAD core
│ ├── _config/ ← Config
│ ├── bmm/ ← Module config
│ ├── custom/ ← Customizations
│ └── scripts/ ← Helper scripts
├── _bmad-output/ ← Output
│ ├── planning-artifacts/ ← Phase 1-3
│ └── implementation-artifacts/ ← Phase 4
├── docs/ ← Documentation
└── src/ ← Source code&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="Copy code"
aria-label="Copy code"
data-copied-label="Copied!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Khi nào dùng BMAD?&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="khi-nào-dùng-bmad"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#khi-n%c3%a0o-d%c3%b9ng-bmad" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YES&lt;/strong&gt; — Project phức tạp, cần planning kỹ&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YES&lt;/strong&gt; — Team muốn structured workflow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NO&lt;/strong&gt; — Project nhỏ, quick prototype&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NO&lt;/strong&gt; — Team chưa quen với AI-assisted development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>